@startuml sick-leave-flow-en
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
title Order of writes: opening, extending and closing a sick leave

participant "Sick leave service" as SVC #E8F0FE
participant "DHP FHIR server" as DHP #DCFCE7
participant "Consumer" as C #FEF3C7

note over SVC, DHP : Patient, Practitioner and Organization already exist in the DHP

== Opening ==
SVC -> DHP : POST Condition (preliminary, provisional)
SVC -> DHP : POST RelatedPerson, if the document has one
SVC -> DHP : POST CarePlan (opened, active)\nreferences the Condition and the RelatedPerson
SVC -> DHP : POST Observation (basedOn the CarePlan)

== Extending ==
SVC -> DHP : PUT CarePlan (extended, active)\nnew incapacityPeriod and statusHistory entry

== Closing ==
SVC -> DHP : POST Condition (final, confirmed)
SVC -> DHP : PUT Condition (preliminary): clinicalStatus resolved
SVC -> DHP : PUT CarePlan (closed, completed)\nreferences both diagnoses

== Reading ==
C -> DHP : GET CarePlan/{id}
DHP --> C : current version
C -> DHP : read the referenced Condition, Observation...

caption A resource is written after the resources it references
@enduml
